# Union-merge the changelog so parallel PRs appending under [Unreleased]
# don't conflict. git keeps both sides' added lines instead of raising a
# conflict, which suits an accrue-only list. Re-tidy any duplicate headers
# or odd ordering at release time, when [Unreleased] is reviewed anyway.
# Keep this scoped to CHANGELOG.md only: union is wrong for the cache-bust
# HTML and the i18n variants, where a silent both-sides merge would corrupt
# output rather than just look untidy.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
